            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una instancia de la clase <code>Sprite</code> que no tiene un constructor. Llama al método <code>draw</code>.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sprite drawn!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Sprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code> seguido de <code>new</code> y luego <code>Sprite()</code>, <code>sprite1</code>, <code>.draw()</code>.</p></body></html>"
